            "provider": "fake",
            "role": "assistant",
            "stopReason": "toolUse",
            "timestamp": "<epoch-ms>",
            "usage": {
              "cacheRead": 40,
              "cacheWrite": 0,
              "input": 100,
              "output": 10,
              "totalTokens": 150
            }
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "{\"registryVersion\":\"<hex16:1>\",\"contractVersion\":1,\"items\":[{\"name\":\"schedule\",\"category\":\"schedule\",\"uiLabel\":\"Schedule\",\"contractVersion\":1,\"description\":\"Run a task later, or repeatedly, as a new agent session: the user's scheduled tasks (cron). Each run starts fresh in the chosen workspace with only the prompt, so write the prompt to stand on its own. Nobody watches a run live; the user reads its final message in the schedule's history.\\n\\nActions:\\n\\n- list: the schedules you may manage, with ids and their last run.\\n- create: propose a schedule. It exists only once the user approves it in this chat. Give cron (5 fields: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week, e.g. `0 9 * * 1-5`) for a repeating one, or at (e.g. \\\"2026-10-01T09:00\\\") for a single run.\\n- update: propose a change to one (id plus the fields to change); the user approves it too.\\n- pause / resume / delete: take effect at once (id).\\n- result: a run's final message (id of the run, like r1a2b3c4d), in 12000-character chunks; call again with offset set to the reported next offset until none is given.\\n\\nTimes are read in timezone (IANA, e.g. \\\"Asia/Taipei\\\"); it defaults to the gateway's. Today is <today>.\",\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"list\",\"create\",\"update\",\"pause\",\"resume\",\"delete\",\"result\"]},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The schedule (like s1a2b3c4d) for update, pause, resume and delete; the run (like r1a2b3c4d) for result\"},\"offset\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0,\"description\":\"With result: first result character to return (default 0)\"},\"prompt\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"What the scheduled agent should do, standing on its own\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A short title; it names each run session\"},\"cron\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Repeat: 5-field cron expression\"},\"at\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Once: ISO 8601 time; without an offset it is read in timezone\"},\"timezone\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"IANA time zone for cron and at\"},\"workspace\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Where it runs (workspace id or name). Default: this workspace. Only the assistant may pick another one.\"},\"notify\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"all\",\"problems\",\"none\"],\"description\":\"Push notifications: every run (all, the default), only runs that fail, are missed or wait for the user (problems), or none. Pick problems for frequent schedules.\"}},\"required\":[\"action\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"resultSchema\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"list\"},\"timezone\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"schedules\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workspace\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"when\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The cron expression or one-off time, as text\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"nextRun\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"model\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"thinking\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"notify\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"prompt\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"lastRun\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"due\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"result\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resultChars\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"status\",\"due\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"title\",\"workspace\",\"when\",\"status\",\"prompt\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"timezone\",\"schedules\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"create\"},\"proposalId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The user approves it in the chat; it does not exist until then\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"proposalId\",\"title\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"update\"},\"proposalId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"proposalId\",\"title\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"pause\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"nextRun\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"id\",\"title\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"resume\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"nextRun\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"id\",\"title\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"delete\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"id\",\"title\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"handle\",\"mimeType\",\"bytes\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"action\":{\"const\":\"result\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The run\"},\"schedule\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"session\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"result\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"This chunk of the result\"},\"resultOffset\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"resultChars\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"nextOffset\":{\"type\":[\"integer\",\"null\"],\"description\":\"Where the next chunk starts, or null at the end\"}},\"required\":[\"text\",\"action\",\"id\",\"schedule\",\"status\",\"result\",\"resultOffset\",\"resultChars\",\"nextOffset\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}]},\"errors\":[\"ApprovalDenied\",\"CapabilityUnavailable\",\"InvalidArguments\",\"QuotaExceeded\",\"Cancelled\",\"Timeout\",\"OperationFailed\"],\"effects\":[\"external\",\"write\"],\"concurrency\":\"exclusive-write\",\"readActions\":[\"list\",\"result\"],\"approval\":\"action-dependent\",\"suspension\":[\"approval\"],\"examples\":[\"const result = await tools.schedule({ action: \\\"…\\\" });\"]}],\"truncated\":false,\"nextCursor\":null}",
                "type": "text"
